        "ratio": "4x5",
        "body": "<p>Skinbiotic+ combines organic inulin with multiple probiotic organisms in a synbiotic formula designed around gut health and the gut-skin connection. Its formula includes:</p><ul><li>Organic inulin</li><li>Lactobacillus plantarum</li><li>Bifidobacterium lactis</li><li>Lactobacillus rhamnosus</li><li>Bifidobacterium bifidum</li><li>Akkermansia muciniphila Akk11®</li></ul><p>The formulation rationale is the prebiotic and probiotic pairing, and the different ecological roles of the organisms.</p><p><strong>Key support areas:</strong> gut-skin connection, microbiome balance, synbiotic support, daily internal balance.†</p>",
