        "ratio": "4x5",
        "body": "<p>Dermaboost+ combines eight vitamins, minerals, carotenoids, and botanical ingredients selected for broader nutritional, antioxidant, and normal immune-supportive roles.† The formula includes:</p><ul><li>Niacinamide</li><li>Vitamin D3</li><li>Vitamin C</li><li>Zinc</li><li>Quercetin</li><li>Curcumin</li><li>Olive leaf extract</li><li>Astaxanthin</li></ul><p>The formulation rationale identifies several complementary ingredient relationships, including quercetin + curcumin, quercetin + vitamin C, quercetin + astaxanthin, curcumin + olive leaf, and vitamin C + zinc.</p><p><strong>Key support areas:</strong> antioxidant support, normal immune function, nutritional skin support, daily skin resilience.†</p>",
