    "microbiome": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "light",
        "align": "left",
        "width": "wide",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "The microbiome does more than digest food.",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "body": "<p>Intestinal microorganisms interact with the body through:</p><ul><li>Metabolites</li><li>Barrier signaling</li><li>Nutrient processing</li><li>Immune communication</li></ul><p>Skinbiotic+ supports the microbial environment through prebiotic fiber and multiple probiotic organisms.† Dermaboost+ contributes nutrients associated with normal immune physiology.</p><p><em>Supporting normal immune function is not the same as treating an immune-mediated skin condition.</em></p><h3>Broader support beyond the microbiome.†</h3><p>Dermaboost+ expands the bundle beyond gut support through a combination of:†</p><ul><li>Vitamin C</li><li>Quercetin</li><li>Curcumin</li><li>Olive leaf polyphenols</li><li>Astaxanthin</li><li>Niacinamide</li></ul><p>These ingredients contribute different antioxidant and nutritional roles. The purpose is broader support for the normal biological systems involved in everyday skin resilience.†</p>"
      }
    },
